{"4247440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Leafborn", "steam_appid": 4247440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4977160], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leafborn</strong> is a fast-paced action game that puts you in command of a being made of thousands of leaves. Discover new forms and abilities throughout the universe of <strong>Canopy</strong>, filled with floating islands, and fight <strong>Nulls</strong>, invading robots that have come to drain this world of its life energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/ff0ff0280356fabf4e0147ad4b99800f.poster.avif?t=1787378181\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/ff0ff0280356fabf4e0147ad4b99800f.webm?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/ff0ff0280356fabf4e0147ad4b99800f.mp4?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shapeshift and Rewrite the Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character can take on different forms, and every ability behaves differently depending on your current form. Become a tornado that sends enemies flying or a saw that cuts straight through them. Combine forms and abilities to create your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/56b3aeb0493c66f9e24d7c65eccd09e4.poster.avif?t=1787378181\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/56b3aeb0493c66f9e24d7c65eccd09e4.webm?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/56b3aeb0493c66f9e24d7c65eccd09e4.mp4?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose, Strike, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival comes not from defense but from offense. Victory belongs to those who move fast, read the enemy's moves, and use their forms and abilities in the right combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Horizon Every Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide between floating islands as you face increasingly vicious robots. Every run starts from scratch, but your progress is permanent. Use the upgrades you earn between runs to unlock new forms and abilities, expand the loot pool, and reach unexplored routes across Canopy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a shapeshifting swarm of more than 10,000 leaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, shapeshift, and glide with your fluid body of leaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new forms and transform into them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear invading robots apart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, action-packed 3D roguelite</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leafborn</strong> is a fast-paced action game that puts you in command of a being made of thousands of leaves. Discover new forms and abilities throughout the universe of <strong>Canopy</strong>, filled with floating islands, and fight <strong>Nulls</strong>, invading robots that have come to drain this world of its life energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/ff0ff0280356fabf4e0147ad4b99800f.poster.avif?t=1787378181\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/ff0ff0280356fabf4e0147ad4b99800f.webm?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/ff0ff0280356fabf4e0147ad4b99800f.mp4?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shapeshift and Rewrite the Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character can take on different forms, and every ability behaves differently depending on your current form. Become a tornado that sends enemies flying or a saw that cuts straight through them. Combine forms and abilities to create your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/56b3aeb0493c66f9e24d7c65eccd09e4.poster.avif?t=1787378181\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/56b3aeb0493c66f9e24d7c65eccd09e4.webm?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/extras/56b3aeb0493c66f9e24d7c65eccd09e4.mp4?t=1787378181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose, Strike, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival comes not from defense but from offense. Victory belongs to those who move fast, read the enemy's moves, and use their forms and abilities in the right combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New Horizon Every Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide between floating islands as you face increasingly vicious robots. Every run starts from scratch, but your progress is permanent. Use the upgrades you earn between runs to unlock new forms and abilities, expand the loot pool, and reach unexplored routes across Canopy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a shapeshifting swarm of more than 10,000 leaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, shapeshift, and glide with your fluid body of leaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new forms and transform into them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear invading robots apart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, action-packed 3D roguelite</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Leafborn is a fast-paced action game where you command a being made of thousands of leaves. Explore a universe of floating islands, discover new abilities, shapeshift, and mercilessly tear apart Nulls robots draining this world's life energy!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Greek", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/001c693c42fbd97210d04849b95306b69024a325/header.jpg?t=1787378181", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/a3478d908b1699513b56501e7efb3dd3fcc34e98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787378181", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247440/a3478d908b1699513b56501e7efb3dd3fcc34e98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787378181", "website": "https://leafborngame.net/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 Or Intel equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Or AMD RX 5500 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A gamepad is recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b